@startuml
title Feature 002 - Account, Catalog and First Worksheet
actor Teacher
participant UI
participant "Account / Source API" as API
participant "Google OIDC + Drive + Sheets" as G
database SQLite as DB
Teacher -> UI : authorize account
UI -> API : begin OAuth (CSRF)
API -> G : state + nonce + required scopes
G --> API : callback code
API -> G : exchange and verify identity
API -> API : verify state / nonce / aud / iss / exp\nsub becomes owner; tokens memory only
API --> UI : account + new authGeneration
UI -> UI : clear previous account state\nignore old generation replies
UI -> API : list(query, cursor)
API -> G : files.list(native Sheets, not trashed)
G --> API : items + nextPageToken + incompleteSearch
API --> UI : canEdit + labels + nextCursor + incomplete
Teacher -> UI : select spreadsheet
UI -> API : preview(spreadsheetId)
API -> G : capabilities + metadata
G --> API : canEdit + sheet properties
API -> API : select index = 0, not first GRID
alt read-only or first worksheet unsupported
  API --> UI : explicit failure; no fallback worksheet
else supported first worksheet
  API -> G : read selected sheetId only
  G --> API : cells + merges
  alt no questions or ambiguous
    API --> UI : reject preview; no fallback worksheet
  else valid question mapping
  API --> UI : owner-bound preview + fingerprint + expiry
  Teacher -> UI : confirm preview and group count
  UI -> API : create(requestId, previewId, groupCount)
  API -> G : revalidate edit access and first-sheet snapshot
  G --> API : current source
  alt changed / expired / account switched
    API --> UI : conflict / re-preview; no partial activity
  else unchanged
    API -> DB : transaction: owner + waiting + snapshot + groups\nslot + account command receipt
    DB --> API : committed
    API --> UI : activityId + student URL
  end
  end
end
Teacher -> UI : switch account A to B
UI -> API : reauthorize
API -> API : invalidate A generation and subscriptions\nnever use B tokens for A jobs
UI -> UI : clear A catalog / history / details
UI -> API : list history as B
API -> DB : WHERE owner = verified B sub
DB --> API : B records only
API --> UI : B history
@enduml
